{"id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-essentially-undecidable.md","title":"Essentially Undecidable","display":"df-essentially-undecidable — Essentially Undecidable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-essentially-undecidable","aliases":["90-df-essentially-undecidable"],"display":"df-essentially-undecidable — Essentially Undecidable","depends_on":["[[90-df-decidable-theory]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-essentially-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-essentially-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-essentially-undecidable — Essentially Undecidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06f1ec898bae8895\" href=\"?note=06f1ec898bae8895\" title=\"90-df-decidable-theory\">90-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> (fixed effective signature and effective Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theories)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\\)</span> (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}\\)</span> (decidable-theory predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"06f1ec898bae8895\" href=\"?note=06f1ec898bae8895\" title=\"90-df-decidable-theory\">90-df-decidable-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}\\)</span> (essential-undecidability predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 取句子公理集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq S\">\\(K\\subseteq S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的同变量表签名包含；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K\">\\(\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K\\)</span>，最后一式以呈示自身语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)\\)</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 的子集定义同名调用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pres}_K\">\\(\\mathrm{Pres}_K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 本身不改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-呈示，编码仍用当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=S\">\\(K=S\\)</span> 是原同语言调用的特例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}undecidable}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\n\\forall U\\;\\bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\n\\rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(U)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}undecidable}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\n\\forall U\\;\\bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\n\\rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(U)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\mathcal P)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\mathcal P)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 相对于固定语法编码本质不可判定</li>\n<li>所有包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的、一致且可有效公理化的理论都不可判定。</li>\n<li>PA和Robinson算术Q都是本质不可判定的</li>\n<li>与可判定理论对比 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"06f1ec898bae8895\" href=\"?note=06f1ec898bae8895\" title=\"90-df-decidable-theory\">90-df-decidable-theory</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}$ (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ (metatheoretic consistency predicate, see [[90-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}$ (decidable-theory predicate, see [[90-df-decidable-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"原 $T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 取句子公理集。$K\\subseteq S$ 使用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的同变量表签名包含；对 $\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K$，最后一式以呈示自身语言 $K$ 中的 $\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)$ 作为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 的子集定义同名调用。$\\mathrm{Pres}_K$、$\\operatorname{Ax}$ 见 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]；$\\mathcal P$ 本身不改写为 $S$-呈示，编码仍用当前 $S,g$。$K=S$ 是原同语言调用的特例。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"原 $T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 取句子公理集。$K\\subseteq S$ 使用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的同变量表签名包含；对 $\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K$，最后一式以呈示自身语言 $K$ 中的 $\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)$ 作为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 的子集定义同名调用。$\\mathrm{Pres}_K$、$\\operatorname{Ax}$ 见 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]；$\\mathcal P$ 本身不改写为 $S$-呈示，编码仍用当前 $S,g$。$K=S$ 是原同语言调用的特例。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"与可判定理论对比 (see [[90-df-decidable-theory]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g","display":false},{"tex":"T,U","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pres}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S,g","display":false},{"tex":"K=S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}undecidable}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\n\\forall U\\;\\bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\n\\rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(U)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\mathcal P)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2237,"backlinks":[{"id":"3edeb874814e8c15","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] — 本质不完备性"},{"id":"3311a5322079aa93","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S$，$Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 保持原算术呈示；$\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)$ 使用 [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] 的子语言呈示适配，即以原 $\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)$ 的 $S$-句子集视图调用，不把 $Q$ 的三元组分量换成 $S$。"},{"id":"30209339bd5901cf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"| `wordenc`、`worddec` | 带元数前缀的数值元组词编码及像集上的部分逆；空元组的词码是单个位0。 | [[90-df-encoding]] |\n| `AcceptNum`、`EffNum`、`s_{m,n}` | 有效通用求值、覆盖及全递归翻译；s-m-n保留程序索引在先的顺序。 | [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]、[[90-thm-smn]] |\n| `Halts_M`、`Output_M`、`Comp_k^{88}` | 本地通用双向纸带的停机、词输出及数值可计算性；不等同于半无限纸带历史码。 | [[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]、[[90-df-computable-function]] |\n| 子语言呈示的 `EssUnd_{S,g}(P)` | 对P自身语言中的Ax视图作句子集嵌入，不改P三元组及当前S,g。 | [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] |"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[